nt","s":"Ira Robbins","x":"A tangible result of the improvement and streamlining of our workforce is that our reported net income per employee was up over 20% from the prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/31/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q4-2018-earnings-confe.aspx"},{"c":"VLY 2019 Q1","e":"vly","d":"2019-04-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Iadanza","x":"So the expectation is you're not going back up from here, is that we continue to drive this number lower as we continue to implement some of the cost saving initiatives throughout the entire organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"VLY 2019 Q1","e":"vly","d":"2019-04-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Iadanza","x":"There is about $4.8 million of severance in that number.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"VLY 2019 Q3","e":"vly","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ira Robbins","x":"The bank's transformation from manual to more automated processes combined with the streamline delivery systems are creating greater operating efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/24/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"VLY 2019 Q4","e":"vly","d":"2020-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Hagedorn","x":"After adjusting for merger related severance costs and backing out direct Oritani related expenses from December, we saw a decline of approximately $1.6 million from third quarter '19.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"VLY 2020 Q1","e":"vly","d":"2020-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael D. Hagedorn","x":"And I know on a total basis, our total cost savings right now are running around 70% just in the first quarter, so we're almost all the way there and we'll get the rest of that in the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"VLY 2020 Q2","e":"vly","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael D. Hagedorn","x":"We had previously identified the meaningful and unique funding cost reduction opportunity available to us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"VLY 2020 Q2","e":"vly","d":"2020-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael D. Hagedorn","x":"For example, it is possible that changing employee work patterns and customer behaviors may lead to further cost reduction opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"VLY 2020 Q3","e":"vly","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ira Robbins","x":"And future operating leverage will be dependent on our ability to identify and execute on incremental cost savings and revenue opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"VLY 2020 Q3","e":"vly","d":"2020-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ira Robbins","x":"Expense controls remain a key focus and we will need to work harder to identify cost reduction opportunities in some cases by leveraging new technologies and solutions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"VLY 2020 Q4","e":"vly","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ira D. Robbins","x":"Exclusive of charges for debt extinguishment and severance, adjusted net income was $113 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"VLY 2020 Q4","e":"vly","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Hagedorn","x":"Our fourth quarter results included nearly $12 million of pre-tax debt extinguishment and severance charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/03/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q4-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"VLY 2021 Q1","e":"vly","d":"2021-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael D. Hagedorn","x":"When you look at the sequential change from fourth quarter to first quarter, 8 basis points, the two largest increases that drove that were the impact of PPP and the impact of our interest-bearing liability, cost reduction, both of which we think are going to be robust going into the second quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/29/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q1-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"VLY 2021 Q2","e":"vly","d":"2021-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ira Robbins","x":"I think when we look at our adjusted efficiency ratio, obviously the current number is impacted because of PPP as well, but we have, as you mentioned, done a lot over the last few years to try to right size the organization based on an appropriate foundation to really grow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"VLY 2021 Q2","e":"vly","d":"2021-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael D. Hagedorn","x":"Those investments are being made so that we can be a more efficient entity in the future, we can service customers differently and faster, we can release some of the redundancies in our processes and streamline our workflows.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/22/valley-national-bancorp-vly-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"VLY 2025 Q2","e":"vly","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Ira Robbins","x":"Know there was a lot of noise regarding tariffs previously, I think we really bank a unique client that really is that small to midsize business that has the agility to really capitalize on what happens with tariffs and some of the uncertainty.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/valley-vly-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VLY 2025 Q2","e":"vly","d":"2025-07-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ira Robbins","x":"And the ability to really have some pricing power within those individual verticals as we continue to expand some of those real relationships.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/valley-vly-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VLY 2025 Q4","e":"vly","d":"2026-01-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ira Robbins","x":"Past investments in data analytics, artificial intelligence, and sales effectiveness are making our bankers more productive across the franchise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/valley-national-vly-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VLY 2025 Q4","e":"vly","d":"2026-01-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ira Robbins","x":"Recent investments in branding artificial intelligence solutions, and service model improvements have been designed to accelerate customer acquisition and elevate the client experience which we believe will contribute to future revenue growth and increased franchise value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/valley-national-vly-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VLY 2026 Q1","e":"vly","d":"2026-04-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ira D. Robbins","x":"So having a more efficient organization, the more we can press that, provides an opportunity to really enhance the AI spend as well as other opportunities within the organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/valley-vly-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VLY 2026 Q1","e":"vly","d":"2026-04-23","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst",